Suppose we have a CUDA kernel that performs a simple vector reduction:

```cuda
__global__ void reduce_kernel(float *in, float *out, int N) {
    int i = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x;
    if (i < N) {
        out[blockIdx.x] += in[i];
    }
}
```

